<title>SPAIN: Endesa reaches strategic deal with Enersis.</title>
<headline>Endesa reaches strategic deal with Enersis.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity firm Endesa said on Friday  it had reached a strategic deal with Chile's Enersis worth an initial  $1.24 billion, with a total value of around $1.5 billion, stock market  commission CNMV said.</p>
<p>The deal will take the shape of a joint venture, 55 percent owned  by Endesa and 45 percent owned by Enersis, Endesa said in a letter  to the CNMV.</p>
</text>
